From: Lucas C.S. <lucascs@protonmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] blink/platform/fonts: reach the Rust font code through cxx, not Crubit

Crubit's C++ support library is not in the Chromium tree:
`//build_overrides/crubit.gni` hardcodes `crubit_src_dir` to
`//third_party/rust-toolchain/lib/third_party/crubit`, which exists only
inside Google's bundled Rust toolchain and which the release tarball does
not ship.  With a system Rust sysroot `enable_cpp_api_from_rust` is false,
`cpp_api_from_rust` never defines its `*_bindings` targets, and `gn gen`
dies on `//third_party/blink/renderer/platform`, which depends on two of
them and on `//build/rust/crubit` unconditionally:

  ERROR at //build/rust/crubit/BUILD.gn:11:5: Unable to load
  ".../third_party/rust-toolchain/lib/third_party/crubit/support/BUILD.gn".
      "$crubit_src_dir/support:support_cpp",

Neither consumer has a C++ fallback to gate on, so both go back to `cxx`
(`cxx_bindings` is still a supported `rust_static_library` attribute;
rustfft_ffi in the same file uses it):

 - OpenType format check (fonts/opentype): revert of upstream 493e6c3911e3
   ("Migrate OpenType format check bindings to Crubit", M153), restoring
   the M152 path wholesale -- the `cxx` bridge in format_check.rs,
   `rust::Box<FontFormatInfo>` in the header, and the
   `rust_static_library("font_format_check")` target in platform/BUILD.gn.
   The Rust logic itself is unchanged; the commit only flipped `fn` ->
   `pub fn` and `Box<T>` -> `T`.

 - Incremental Font Transfer (fonts/ift), new in M155 and Crubit-only from
   the start, so there is nothing to revert to.  ift_patcher.rs keeps
   upstream's code untouched and gains a `cxx` bridge at the end that
   exports the same operations; ift_patcher.{h,cc} hold `rust::Box`es
   instead of Crubit value types.  The blink-facing API of IftSubsetDefinition
   and IftPatcher does not change (copying a subset now clones it on the
   Rust side), so ift_patcher_test.cc needs no change.  The feature is
   `status: "test"` in runtime_enabled_features.json5 and nothing outside
   fonts/ift calls it yet; porting rather than stubbing keeps
   --enable-blink-features=IncrementalFontTransfer working.

fonts/BUILD.gn keeps only the IFT target; the format-check one moves to
platform/BUILD.gn as in M152.  Its three `//third_party/rust/...` deps
move with every roll of those crates (M157: font_types v0_12, read_fonts
v0_45, skrifa v0_48).  On a series bump, re-read fonts/BUILD.gn and resync.

M157 moved the font headers and sources out of the platform component into
two source_sets, `font_rust_headers` (consumed by //third_party/blink/
renderer/core) and `font_rust_support`, and gave blink_platform_unittests
its own direct dependency on the two bindings and on //build/rust/crubit.
The Crubit dependencies now sit in `font_rust_headers`' public_deps, which
take the two cxx targets instead, and in the unittests' deps, which drop
them (they already reach both through :font_rust_headers).

Applied only with USE=-bundled-toolchain; with the bundled toolchain the
upstream Crubit path works as-is.  Drop this patch once upstream gates the
Crubit dependency on `enable_cpp_api_from_rust` or ships Crubit's support
library outside the toolchain.
diff -ruN a/third_party/blink/renderer/platform/BUILD.gn b/third_party/blink/renderer/platform/BUILD.gn
--- a/third_party/blink/renderer/platform/BUILD.gn	2026-11-06 04:03:13.288918253 -0300
+++ b/third_party/blink/renderer/platform/BUILD.gn	2026-11-06 04:03:24.245111443 -0300
@@ -219,11 +219,10 @@
     "//third_party/blink/renderer:non_test_config",
   ]
   public_deps = [
+    ":font_format_check",
     ":platform_export",
-    "fonts:font_format_bindings",
-    "fonts:ift_patcher_bindings",
+    "fonts:ift_patcher_rs",
     "//base",
-    "//build/rust/crubit",
     "//skia",
     "//third_party/blink/renderer/platform/wtf",
   ]
@@ -258,6 +257,18 @@
   ]
 }
 
+rust_static_library("font_format_check") {
+  allow_unsafe = true  # Needed for FFI that underpins the `cxx` crate.
+  crate_root = "fonts/opentype/format_check.rs"
+  sources = [ crate_root ]
+  cxx_bindings = [ crate_root ]
+  deps = [
+    "//third_party/rust/font_types/v0_12:lib",
+    "//third_party/rust/read_fonts/v0_45:lib",
+    "//third_party/rust/skrifa/v0_48:lib",
+  ]
+}
+
 rust_static_library("rustfft_ffi") {
   allow_unsafe = true  # Needed for FFI that underpins the `cxx` crate.
   crate_root = "audio/rustfft_ffi.rs"
@@ -2607,9 +2618,6 @@
     ":bridge_ice_controller_tests",
     ":font_rust_headers",
     ":rustfft_ffi_unittests",
-    "fonts:font_format_bindings",
-    "fonts:ift_patcher_bindings",
-    "//build/rust/crubit",
   ]
 
   data_deps = [ ":blink_platform_unittests_data" ]
